 "notes": [
  "Pitch 2/3: [Surface condition and expected batting conditions] Just have a look over here, Scotty. We’ve got two batters here that I think, one’s already spent a good significant amount of this Test match already out there, Tom Latham. But they’re not going to have a bat on. I wouldn’t have expected today because of how flat this surface is. When you look down in it, Scotty, there’s not too much t",
  "Pitch 3/3: [Groundstaff’s revised assessment of the pitch] I’ve got one final question. The groundstaff said they felt this pitch was going to get quicker. They have changed their mind completely. They now think it’s going to get slower as well. [Role of spin bowling and New Zealand’s bowling options] So what about the active spin bowlers and how they’re going to play a part today? I think it will",
  "Matt Henry talking before the start of the day's play 1/2: [It didn’t look like there was much there in the pitch. What has been the chat overnight about how you can get nine more wickets?] Yeah, I think it’s probably going into this game we could, we could see that after that new ball was pretty flat and probably on the low side as well. So for us was probably just how do we restrain the run rate",
  "Jamieson is stretching. Will he have a go, or will he be the one to take the second new ball?",
  "Three overs to the second new ball and Latham wants to use his part-timers to fill in the overs. Rachin is coming on now and will have a couple of overs. Meanwhile, Padikkal is being checked by the physio, his right arm seems to be an issue. Not sure if it is cramp or something else, because he was definitely not hit.",
